  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/origin.html#determining-the-creation-sandboxing-flags\r\n\r\nHi I'm new here. And I doubt why these two `if` are same.\r\n```\r\nIf embedder is an element, then: the flags set on embedder's iframe sandboxing flag set.\r\nIf embedder is an element, then: the flags set on embedder's node document's active sandboxing flag set.\r\n```\r\n\r\nSeems I always fall into the first if condition \"If embedder is an element\".",
